                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell>13. Disposition of the Italian colonies</cell>
                        <cell>543</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell cols="2">C. Politico-Economic questions</cell>
                        <cell>544</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell>1. Improvement of living standards in the Middle East through
                            development of resources and industrialization: Iraq irrigation scheme,
                            The Tana Dam project, Egypt, Palestine, Syria and the Lebanon, Arabia,
                            other Arabian States, Ethiopia, Turkey, Iran and Afghanistan</cell>
                        <cell>544</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell>2. The dollar-sterling problem</cell>
                        <cell>548</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell>3. Technical and economic aid to Middle Eastern countries</cell>
                        <cell>551</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell>4. Petroleum in the Middle East and pipelines: Saudi Arabia, Bahrein,
